# Four POPC lipids of Lipid21 cut from a bilayer of 126 that packmol left
# with close contacts (scripts/validation/barostat-semi/membrane.py, phase
# build): residues 19-21, 79-81, 88-90, and 139-141 of popc.prmtop, each
# lipid made whole and the four centered in a cell of 50 Å, written as
# clash.pdb by ParmEd. Two pairs of hydrogens of different lipids are
# 0.13 Å apart, and the bonds of hydrogen are up to 0.02 Å off their
# lengths. The files are compressed with gzip -9.
source leaprc.lipid21
SYS = loadpdb clash.pdb
set SYS box {50.0 50.0 50.0}
saveamberparm SYS clash.prmtop clash.inpcrd
quit
